{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0543_1000_p", "source_sha256": "b10a5ef6f2e97c9a311295ccd1278a33d1e367af5e8b9af8d349d14ba3eef740", "ja": "（今日はアイドルたちによる大運動会の後に\nライブイベントと、大忙しの一日だった……）", "zh": "（今天先是偶像们参加的大型运动会，之后又有演唱会活动……真是忙碌的一天……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0543_1001_016tsu", "source_sha256": "e343b4bc8cd87ab2669f7e6f54ba368101c3a7b95e49cadaec369b1e1437e056", "ja": "{$P$}さん、お疲れさまで～す♪\n着替え、終わりましたよ。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，辛苦啦～♪\n我换好衣服了哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0543_1002_p", "source_sha256": "a6d5cc34797b497a1aef9393c3abb5f3babb737ebfdb61d902e7116e96c5837b", "ja": "ああ、お疲れさま。\n今日は一日大変だったけど、大丈夫か？", "zh": "啊，辛苦了。\n今天一整天都很辛苦，不过你还好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0543_1003_016tsu", "source_sha256": "8b5769836b6f112bb2e331f1bf601535a06d768218a7ccaf67cfacc9ba8f7308", "ja": "ん～、ちょっと疲れはありますけど……\nでも、すっごく楽しかったから大丈夫で～す！", "zh": "嗯～，虽然有点累……\n不过，因为特别开心，所以没关系～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0543_1004_016tsu", "source_sha256": "1e64e406be759d5f8e58816413a9962fe4d829a9e14546d9d756e30856315da5", "ja": "障害物競走の失敗も、\n最後のライブで挽回できたと思いますし！", "zh": "我觉得障碍物竞走时的失误，也在最后的演唱会上挽回了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0543_1005_p", "source_sha256": "b3dea4c272a0343381e2bf2f6e972ee689fa577d34d531eb68dfde2b152cfca4", "ja": "ははっ、ネットにひっかかったやつか。\nうん、翼の言う通り、しっかり取り返せたと思うぞ。", "zh": "哈哈，是说被网缠住那次吧。\n嗯，就像翼说的，我觉得确实扳回来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0543_1006_016tsu", "source_sha256": "e1dcf9c413c19f4fe54c8b9b2cc7b2fc94c36149c6bdbc716453e4870aebc6ff", "ja": "でしょ♪　カッコ悪いまま終わるのは嫌だったから、\nちょっとがんばっちゃいました！", "zh": "对吧♪我可不想就那么丢脸地收场，所以稍微努力了一下！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0543_1007_016tsu", "source_sha256": "4dd4be2df71d0c6a6e1b999ed6df44fec5cc7191cade302ce4642dc96a69405d", "ja": "あ、でも……わたし、思ったんです。障害物競走の\n失敗も、あれはあれでよかったのかもって。", "zh": "啊，不过……我想了想。障碍物赛跑那次失败，说不定那样也挺好的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0543_1008_p", "source_sha256": "71ab4dddf892326dd497a90500ec71beef7ef581152a6b56aabaa07180320a1d", "ja": "どういうことだ？", "zh": "这是怎么说？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0543_1009_016tsu", "source_sha256": "d57b58b936cb20c635d5561121e60ad09f7badbea110d4818613ce787edb2c01", "ja": "みんな、失敗した姿のあとでライブを見たでしょ？\nだからカッコいい印象しか残ってないと思うんです。", "zh": "大家在看了失败的样子之后又看了演出对吧？\n所以我觉得留下的肯定全都是帅气的印象哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0543_1010_016tsu", "source_sha256": "1c549951fa32015f8d557993cd3f8819e22a0a0d56e8ff0b9ef7f79f9b716377", "ja": "こういうのを、ギャップって言うんですよねー！", "zh": "这种就叫反差，对吧——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0543_1011_p", "source_sha256": "24be9926527ba75214ed599418c462892f8567244c110c669d6b2a7f0aa0a0bd", "ja": "なるほど……。翼の狙いどおりだったわけだ。", "zh": "原来如此……也就是说，一切都在翼的计划之中啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0543_1012_016tsu", "source_sha256": "15ffead929da84a22d8cc106e8c918eff5537cc4e2ba1a9c567963a54e96b906", "ja": "えへへ♪　今度のライブでもやってみようかな？\n最初に失敗しちゃって、後でカッコよく……。", "zh": "嘿嘿♪ 下次的演唱会也试试看吧？\n先故意失败，然后再帅气地……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0543_1013_p", "source_sha256": "600f9df90e8d3924bdae84dae4578bade7913e1280535465854f49736c9f419c", "ja": "おいおい。いくらカッコいいところを\n見せたいからって、わざと失敗するのは……。", "zh": "喂喂。就算想让大家看看帅气的一面，也不能故意失败啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0543_1014_016tsu", "source_sha256": "faa629bad74083541d5308e9d44d4b665f32feab9cdf8e680374176c0c26fe04", "ja": "なーんて。冗談ですよ、冗談！\nまあ、それも悪くないな～って思いますけど……。", "zh": "才不是呢。开个玩笑啦，开个玩笑！\n不过嘛，我倒觉得那样也不错～……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0543_1015_016tsu", "source_sha256": "3c1c4954fa58784d48098e832f61b07ea9da20a203cc8ec14396e58eb927998d", "ja": "やっぱりファンのみんなには、最初から最後まで\nカッコいいわたしを見てほしいもん！　えへへ♪", "zh": "不过果然还是想让粉丝大家从头到尾\n都看到我帅气的一面嘛！嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
